      {
        "id": 214561,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-15T18:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Again she wasn’t in Fugue State mode until OblivAeon so her base power makes sense since she would be relying more on Archery skill. &nbsp; Certainly other powers could be used but I don’t see any thematic issue with her base power. &nbsp;</p>",
