      {
        "id": 214562,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-15T21:35:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, from a playtesting standpoint, we weren’t super aware of the distinction during playtesting either. We knew she did some of the info stuff, and she had several damage dealing cards. The true nature of her powers wasn’t something we were privy to.</p>",
