        "created_at": "2018-02-19T20:15:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I use it to plink off targets. &nbsp;I also combine the power with Critical Multiplier to either take a specific target or make sure my bonus isn’t eaten up by a villain/environment which causes self damage. &nbsp;</p>",
