        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-19T20:17:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was actually thinking that Parse's base power could be \"1 irreducible projectile damage\" - it would reflect the careful targeting well, and while it wouldn't do much damage on its own, it would interact great with Critical Multiplier, Targeting Arrow, and other damage boosters to punch through heavy-DR enemies.&nbsp;</p>",
