        "created_at": "2018-02-25T23:28:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m not sure how to get trick archer from her deck, to me it comes across as a very utilitarian deck; she can analyse things, find the weak spots and when she wants to do damage, no frills, she just does damage.<br>\nShe doesn’t have the fancy tricks in there you might expect from Hawkeye or Green Arrow, especially their earlier stories, so I don’t get the whole trick archer angle from her at all anyway.</p>",
