        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-26T03:20:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The Burning Stickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n The Burning Stickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>They say the quote on Segmentation Fault is from the fight between Parse and Revenant, just that Revenant was muttering it under his breath.But in Editors Note 11, they said it was an instance where the art and quote don't match – that Marc Benedetto said it to her in her backstory.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I should re-listen to the episode to verify, but my understanding was that Marc Benedetto did say that at the time of the fight, but was muttering it under his breath in a way that Parse didn't hear.</p>",
        "post_number": 33,
